  "brief_visual": "New grammar for this reel (differs from duet/php2shell world camera and the xBeat kit): one continuous search-results page. Every beat is the next region of the same page and the camera scrolls down it with momentum, a slight perspective tilt and a soft rack-focus (search-page scroll take). Hero object: one sponsored ad card for an illustrative bakery that persists and transforms (shared element). Techniques: typed AI line inside the card, lock snap on a cursor attempt, flag result rows stacking, review cards compressing into one line, physics drop of negative reviews in a lights-down charcoal act, a predicted-performance meter gating the line, reviews-to-ad-copy morph, phone review composer updating the ad. Headline captions at the top, no bottom subtitles. Official four-colour Google G only. No EXAMPLE stickers: the illustration disclaimer lives in the post caption.",
